#
# the part of lib_darktable that compiles without the GTK, GDK, ATK, Pango
# and librsvg headers. It is what a front end other than the GTK one (the
# iPad port) can build on, and it grows as more of the core is split from
# its GUI code. The dt_core_nogtk target in src/CMakeLists.txt compiles these
# files with those headers off the include path, so that a change pulling
# them back in fails there rather than unnoticed.
#
# Files that are not part of the current configuration (an imageio format
# or feature that is switched off) are skipped.
#
